# Check out LF everywhere, whatever core.autocrlf says. Git for Windows sets
# core.autocrlf=true system-wide, which put CRLF into bash scripts, make
# recipes and template fixtures; MSYS2 bash then read "\r" into values
# (propane: "cluster enabled must be a boolean (got: 0\r)").
* text=auto eol=lf

# HTTP wire-format fixtures are CRLF on purpose; keep their bytes exact.
*.http -text
